            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A water-soluble packaging film according to the present invention is a water-soluble packaging film comprising a polyvinyl alcohol resin, and has, on a film surface, irregularities having a surface roughness (Ra) of 0.3 to 1 µm and a maximum height (Rz) of 3 to 9 µm.</p>
